'''Thunder Jack''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] gacha event. He was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] trades [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] target and [[Immune to Freeze|Freeze Immunity]] for [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] target and [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immunity]].

